  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a suru-verb: {廃止|はいし}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧. Applies to systems, laws, regulations, services, and customs. Distinguish from ⟦{廃棄|はいき}→廃棄：12482_haiki⟧ (disposal of physical objects) and ⟦{撤廃|てっぱい}→撤廃：12911_teppai⟧ (abolition, often of restrictions or barriers). {廃止|はいし} emphasizes the official ending of something that was operational.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{制度|せいど}→制度：03291_seido⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{廃止|はいし}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: abolish a system\n- ⟦{法律|ほうりつ}→法律：01722_houritsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{廃止|はいし}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: repeal a law\n- ⟦{路線|ろせん}→路線：11341_rosen⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{廃止|はいし}: discontinuation of a route\n- ⟦{死刑|しけい}→死刑：13200_shikei⟧{廃止|はいし}: abolition of the death penalty",
